														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3774956">
									

<p>Thanks again! I decided against having exploration logs because I wanted to convey the feeling of emptiness within the rooms. The bunker <em>is</em> infinitely large, so the chances of finding anything are astronomically small. The Foundation was lucky enough to come across Josef's corpse. There are definitely more things in the rooms, but the Foundation just hasn't found most of it. Yet.</p>
<p>The RPS was inspired by <a href="http://submachine.wikia.com/wiki/Compass">the compass</a> from Submachine 3. The entire SCP was inspired by Submachine 3, actually.</p>
<p>Also, the exploration team that Josef found is the one from the disbanded GoI mentioned at the bottom. Or perhaps they were from a different universe's instance of that GoI, that's up to your interpretation.</p>

							</div>

								
					
